WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.072
This is one page of a self-cleaning litter box manual.

2
00:00:04.072 --> 00:00:06.182
Now, watch the same steps.

3
00:00:06.532 --> 00:00:09.644
Press Empty. The globe turns clockwise,

4
00:00:09.644 --> 00:00:11.379
and the litter falls through the port,

5
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:12.875
into the drawer.

6
00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.244
Then press Reset.

7
00:00:15.694 --> 00:00:18.469
Switch off, and unplug.

8
00:00:18.469 --> 00:00:20.997
Pull out the drawer, and remove the bag.

9
00:00:21.694 --> 00:00:25.674
Press both side buttons, and swing the bonnet back.

10
00:00:25.674 --> 00:00:28.260
Then lift the globe off by its handle.

11
00:00:28.911 --> 00:00:32.794
Wash the globe with mild soap, and dry it completely.

12
00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:36.056
The base gets a damp cloth only, never water.

13
00:00:36.706 --> 00:00:39.313
Wipe the sensors with a dry towel.

14
00:00:39.313 --> 00:00:43.479
Then clear the gear track, and the area around the motor gear.

15
00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:46.853
Slide the globe back, flush in the rear bearing,

16
00:00:46.853 --> 00:00:49.506
with the gear track on the motor gear.

17
00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:51.568
Tilted, it will not turn.

18
00:00:52.717 --> 00:00:56.263
Close the bonnet, until both sides click.

19
00:00:56.263 --> 00:00:58.889
Put in a new bag, fill litter to the line,

20
00:00:58.889 --> 00:01:00.590
and press Reset.

21
00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:04.958
Back on its gear, and back to work on its own.
